{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udded About AVILON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVILON</strong> is a powerful tool designed for gamers who want to explore, complete, and truly master their favorite worlds.<br>Built with a modern and customizable interface, AVILON lets you <strong>access interactive maps from multiple games and platforms \u2014 all in one place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your routes, locate collectibles, uncover secrets, and optimize your progress without opening a browser or juggling dozens of tabs.<br>Whether you\u2019re hunting for that final trophy on <strong>PlayStation</strong>, completing achievements on <strong>PC or Xbox</strong>, or simply exploring every corner of your favorite games, AVILON provides the most organized, intuitive, and immersive way to do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Interactive maps</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Add and manage detailed maps for different games and all your gaming platforms. Choose between an interactive map or an image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/3c5c79693d763a752baeda8773e31e6c.avif?t=1761907186\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customizable themes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose from a variety of visual styles and customize your AVILON environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/29d3fd69c9392e5d4280625182f84fb6.poster.avif?t=1761907186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/29d3fd69c9392e5d4280625182f84fb6.webm?t=1761907186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/29d3fd69c9392e5d4280625182f84fb6.mp4?t=1761907186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Clean interface for long gaming sessions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Avilon has a clean and intuitive interface, where you always know where each game is.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/34b804050d09f3671319d33e5ca289d5.avif?t=1761907186\" width=1560 height=1080 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcd8INTEGRATED GUIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Learn everything you need to know about AVILON from within the program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/f16fa9cc63396b32ba287dc448435898.poster.avif?t=1761907186\" width=798 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/f16fa9cc63396b32ba287dc448435898.webm?t=1761907186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/f16fa9cc63396b32ba287dc448435898.mp4?t=1761907186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50 MARK YOUR FAVORITE GAMES WITH ONE CLICK AND ALWAYS HAVE THEM AT HAND.</strong></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/73adcdf07c2c03d01c2812245cb3e97a.poster.avif?t=1761907186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/73adcdf07c2c03d01c2812245cb3e97a.webm?t=1761907186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/73adcdf07c2c03d01c2812245cb3e97a.mp4?t=1761907186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae WHY AVILON?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AVILON isn\u2019t just another utility \u2014 it\u2019s your <strong>gamer control center</strong>.<br>Bring together all your maps and exploration tools in one convenient hub, keep track of your progress, and explore smarter.<br>No more relying on scattered web pages or losing time searching for information: <strong>everything you need is here, in AVILON.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\ude80 IN CONSTANT EVOLUTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is constantly evolving to ensure proper use and to add new features. Keep in mind that AVILON is being developed by a single person, so bugs or errors may be more visible. Nevertheless, I share the roadmap we hope to continue. Your support is very important for the future of AVILON.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112740/extras/83df795accd4d668bbb546a0738e3b60.avif?t=1761907186\" width=1538 height=1024 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112740?t=1761907186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112740?t=1761907186","c